{
  "id": "p02",
  "title": "The Museum Tape",
  "titleZh": "博物馆的磁带",
  "topic": "记忆",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The first room of the old iron museum feels warm and very quiet.",
        "zh": "老铁厂博物馆的第一间屋子又暖又静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A retired man would teach local history in this small town.",
        "zh": "一位退休的老人曾在这个小镇上教本地历史。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My guide asks me to be patient and listen with real care.",
        "zh": "我的向导让我耐心点，认真听。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I must search a dark storeroom for an old and plastic tape.",
        "zh": "我得在一间昏暗的储藏室里找一盒旧塑料磁带。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Two shelves are black, and a third shelf lies almost completely bare.",
        "zh": "两个架子是黑的，第三个架子几乎空无一物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I read the seventh number on a dusty old wooden box.",
        "zh": "我读出一只落满灰尘的旧木箱上的第七个编号。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My hands do not understand why it even matters so much today.",
        "zh": "我的双手不明白，为什么这件事今天还如此要紧。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A friend carries the box toward the crowded old front desk.",
        "zh": "一位朋友把箱子搬向拥挤的旧前台。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We stay inside a small bedroom and wait for complete, total silence.",
        "zh": "我们待在一间小卧室里，等着彻底的安静。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Then the tape begins with the low, tired, quiet voice of a cook.",
        "zh": "接着，磁带里响起一个厨子低沉、疲倦又安静的声音。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She talks about low pay, hard labour and the long war.",
        "zh": "她讲起微薄的工资、辛苦的劳动和那场漫长的战争。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her words have a meaning beyond their plain and daily sound.",
        "zh": "她的话有超出日常字面声音的意义。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My chest feels tight when she names that wide open field.",
        "zh": "当她念到那片开阔的田野时，我胸口发紧。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sick child once slept in this very small back room.",
        "zh": "曾有一个生病的孩子睡在这间很小的后屋里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her mother brought cool juice and stayed near the cot.",
        "zh": "她母亲端来凉果汁，守在床边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The child is long dead, and the whole family has gone.",
        "zh": "那孩子早已去世，全家也都离开了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I wonder what spirit kept these tired old workers standing there.",
        "zh": "我想知道是什么精神让这些疲惫的老工人站在那里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The director advises me on writing about their quiet pride.",
        "zh": "馆长给我建议，教我怎么写他们那种安静的骄傲。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A school magazine may influence how we see this sleepy little place.",
        "zh": "一本校刊也许会影响我们怎么看这个昏昏欲睡的小地方。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "During the conference, visitors will enter the very same small room.",
        "zh": "会议期间，参观者会走进同一间小屋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A recent mail asks for the box and its paper label.",
        "zh": "最近一封邮件索要这只箱子和它的纸质标签。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We must protect the box and keep a high and clear standard.",
        "zh": "我们必须保护好这只箱子，保持高而明确的标准。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This difficulty is associated with the old plastic recording.",
        "zh": "这个困难与那盘旧塑料录音有关。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then it probably runs fast and slips quietly away.",
        "zh": "然后它大概会转得很快，悄悄溜走。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My eyes watch the wheels stop at the very end of it.",
        "zh": "我盯着轮子，直到它在最末尾停下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A grey cloud hides a planet; heaven feels far.",
        "zh": "一片灰云遮住了一颗行星；天堂显得遥远。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At sixteen I walk slowly home under a wide and quiet evening sky.",
        "zh": "十六岁的我，在宽阔安静的夜空下慢慢走回家。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Sharing that history is enough for me now.",
        "zh": "如今，能分享那段历史对我就够了。"
      }
    ]
  ],
